## Automated Installation (SQLcl)
To install this theme into your application using SQLcl:

```bash
./install.sh --connection <saved-connection> --workspace <workspace> --app-id <app-id> [--with-switcher | --without-switcher] [--apply]
```

Without `--apply`, the script runs in dry-run mode, validates target compatibility, and previews changes.

## Automated Uninstallation (SQLcl)
To remove this theme from your application:

```bash
./uninstall.sh --connection <saved-connection> --workspace <workspace> --app-id <app-id> [--apply]
```

